#. ja: オリエンタル・オレンジバスケットEX
#. de: exklusiv[a] fernöstlich[a] Orangenkorb
#. fr: corbeille d'oranges orientales spéciale
#. column 2: jumbo oriental orange baskets
#. column 8: Oriental oranges, while small, are far softer and sweeter than the oranges found growing in Eorzea. The difference in size with a normal oriental orange basket is indiscernible to all but the most observant.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 6)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +2<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
#. column 9: Jumbo Oriental Orange Basket
msgctxt "Item:16000:0:0"
msgid "jumbo oriental orange basket"
msgstr "гигантская корзина восточных апельсинов"

#. de: exklusiv[a] fernöstlich[a] Orangenkörbe
#. fr: corbeilles d'oranges orientales spéciales
#. column 0: jumbo oriental orange basket
#. column 8: Oriental oranges, while small, are far softer and sweeter than the oranges found growing in Eorzea. The difference in size with a normal oriental orange basket is indiscernible to all but the most observant.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 6)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +2<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
