#. ja: スノーマンEX
#. de: exklusiv[a] Schneemann
#. fr: bonhomme de neige spécial
#. column 2: jumbo snowmen
#. column 8: Garlean scholars have conducted extensive studies on the subject of why Eorzean snowmen are constructed of only two balls of snow rather than three─the number of choice throughout Ilsabard. The prevailing theory is that extensive studies should not have been conducted on said subject. The difference in size with a normal snowman is indiscernible to all but the most observant.
#. column 9: Jumbo Snowman
msgctxt "Item:16006:0:0"
msgid "jumbo snowman"
msgstr "гигантский снеговик"

