#. ja: 超小型トームストーン
#. de: winzig[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: micromémoquartz allagois
#. column 2: micro tomestones
#. column 8: Similar to the more common tomestones believed to store the lost knowledge of the Allagan Empire, yet at the fraction of the size, micro tomestones are highly sought by collectors and scholars alike. However, that was before the market became flooded with this particular variety, and as a result, it is no longer accepted as a viable bartering material.
#. column 9: Micro Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:16541:0:0"
msgid "micro tomestone"
msgstr "Микротомстоун"

#. de: winzig[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: micromémoquartz allagois
#. column 0: micro tomestone
#. column 8: Similar to the more common tomestones believed to store the lost knowledge of the Allagan Empire, yet at the fraction of the size, micro tomestones are highly sought by collectors and scholars alike. However, that was before the market became flooded with this particular variety, and as a result, it is no longer accepted as a viable bartering material.
#. column 9: Micro Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:16541:0:2"
msgid "micro tomestones"
msgstr "Микротомстоуны"

#. ja: 古代の情報が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。サイズの小型化に成功している。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Wie die größeren und weiter verbreiteten Allagischen Steine enthält diese Miniaturversion ebenfalls Wissen des Allagischen Reiches, allerdings in einem viel handlicheren Format. Leider interessiert sich niemand mehr für diese Objekte.
#. fr: Cette pierre, vestige de la civilisation allagoise, renferme des con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces ancestrales. L'avancée technologique a permis sa miniaturisation. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: micro tomestone
#. column 2: micro tomestones
#. column 9: Micro Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:16541:0:8"
msgid "Similar to the more common tomestones believed to store the lost knowledge of the Allagan Empire, yet at the fraction of the size, micro tomestones are highly sought by collectors and scholars alike. However, that was before the market became flooded with this particular variety, and as a result, it is no longer accepted as a viable bartering material."
msgstr "Микротомстоуны — уменьшенные копии более известных томстоунов, в которых, как считается, хранится утраченная мудрость Аллаганской империи. Когда-то за ними охотились коллекционеры и учёные, но на рынке их стало так много, что теперь ими уже не расплатишься."

#. ja: 超小型トームストーン
#. de: Winziger Allagischer Stein
#. fr: Micromémoquartz allagois
#. column 0: micro tomestone
#. column 2: micro tomestones
#. column 8: Similar to the more common tomestones believed to store the lost knowledge of the Allagan Empire, yet at the fraction of the size, micro tomestones are highly sought by collectors and scholars alike. However, that was before the market became flooded with this particular variety, and as a result, it is no longer accepted as a viable bartering material.
msgctxt "Item:16541:0:9"
msgid "Micro Tomestone"
msgstr "Микротомстоун"

#. ja: 紺青の硬化薬
#. de: Phiole[p] tiefschwarzen Indigo-Gobhärters
#. fr: fiole d'agent solidifiant quintessencié de la Main indigo
#. column 2: flasks of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of Idyllshire's goblin goldsmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of precious stones and found that it heightens the attributes of the gear and accessories crafted in their workshops. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Illuminati Darkest Gobcoat
msgctxt "Item:16542:0:0"
msgid "flask of Illuminati darkest gobcoat"
msgstr "Флакон густой гобской пропитки Синей руки"

#. de: Phiolen[p] tiefschwarzen Indigo-Gobhärters
#. fr: fioles d'agent solidifiant quintessencié de la Main indigo
#. column 0: flask of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of Idyllshire's goblin goldsmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of precious stones and found that it heightens the attributes of the gear and accessories crafted in their workshops. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Illuminati Darkest Gobcoat
msgctxt "Item:16542:0:2"
msgid "flasks of Illuminati darkest gobcoat"
msgstr "Флаконы густой гобской пропитки Синей руки"

#. ja: 青の手が作り出した新型錬金薬。<br>イディルシャイア製帯防具及びアクセサリの硬化に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【アクセサリ】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine alchemistische Substanz aus den finsteren Laboren der Indigohand. Sie verstärkt die Eigenschaften bestimmter hinterländischer Ausrüstung und Accessoires.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Accessoires benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Bien plus puissante que ses prédécesseuses, cette mixture est le fruit de plusieurs années de recherche de la part des alchimistes de la Main indigo. Elle est assez puissante pour améliorer l'efficacité des ceintures et des accessoires idylléens, mais de meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 2: flasks of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 9: Illuminati Darkest Gobcoat
msgctxt "Item:16542:0:8"
msgid "An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of Idyllshire's goblin goldsmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of precious stones and found that it heightens the attributes of the gear and accessories crafted in their workshops. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Алхимическое зелье, созданное в мрачных лабораториях Синей руки. Золотых дел мастера-гоблины из Идиллии наносили эту необычайно вязкую субстанцию на драгоценные камни и обнаружили, что она усиливает свойства изготовленных ими доспехов и аксессуаров. Но технологии ремесла шагнули вперёд, и зелье устарело."

#. ja: 紺青の硬化薬
