#. column 0: flask of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 2: flasks of Illuminati darkest gobcoat
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of Idyllshire's goblin goldsmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of precious stones and found that it heightens the attributes of the gear and accessories crafted in their workshops. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:16542:0:9"
msgid "Illuminati Darkest Gobcoat"
msgstr "Густая гобская пропитка Синей руки"

