msgid "An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of Idyllshire's goblin smithies have applied the unnaturally illuminated substance to a variety of metals and found that it heightens the attributes of weapons crafted in their forges. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
