#. column 0: fourth page of the <i>Alexandrian Manifesto</i>
#. column 2: fourth pages of the <i>Alexandrian Manifesto</i>
#. column 9: Alexandrian Manifesto - Page 4
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:16556:0:8"
msgid "The fourth page of the Illuminati's least-known catechismal masterwork.<br><br>Manifesto pages of the same type can be traded for special gear."
