#. column 8: The realm's premier publication on beauty and fashion, this specific copy of <i>Modern Aesthetics</i> covers, in detail, methods for styling longer hair.<br><br>Use to unlock a new hairstyle at the aesthetician.<br>Unavailable to female Hrothgar.
