#. fr: requin-lame allagois
#. column 2: Allagan bladesharks
#. column 8: Only found near the Flagship in Azys Lla, the bladeshark is an alpha predator with few enemies─a true lord of the skies.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
