#. ja: ロウェナの手形:聖典
#. de: Rowena-Marke[p] „Theologie“
#. fr: avoir de Rowena (théologique/poétique)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (scripture)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of scripture or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Scripture)
msgctxt "Item:16928:0:0"
msgid "Rowena's token (scripture)"
msgstr "Жетон Ровены (священные писания)"

#. de: Rowena-Marken[p] „Theologie“
#. fr: avoirs de Rowena (théologiques/poétiques)
#. column 0: Rowena's token (scripture)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of scripture or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Scripture)
msgctxt "Item:16928:0:2"
msgid "Rowena's tokens (scripture)"
msgstr "Жетоны Ровены (священные писания)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:聖典もしくは詩学を納品した証となる商人ロウェナの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Rowena für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Theologie oder Poesie ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Rowena des mémoquartz allagois théologiques ou poétiques. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Rowena's token (scripture)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (scripture)
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Scripture)
msgctxt "Item:16928:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of scripture or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Расписка от Ровены за сдачу аллаганских томов священных писаний или поэтики. После смены правил Дома диковин жетон обесценился и теперь не стоит даже бумаги, на которой написан."

#. ja: ロウェナの手形:聖典
